 ## How the kanji combine
 
-[武](../kanji/武.md) contributes military or martial activity, and 器 contributes an implement or instrument. Together they name an implement for armed conflict. The on readings are ブ + キ. This component relationship explains the compound's sense, not the historical shape of either character.
